<div class="landing-hero">
  <div class="landing-aurora" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="landing-grid">
    <section>
      <p class="landing-kicker">One Child, One Shared Story</p>
      <h1>Support Your Child's Growth With Everyone Working Together</h1>
      <p class="landing-lead">
        Wayfinder helps parents, teachers, and family members stay aligned around what a child needs most.
        From school updates to report cards to family observations, everything is organized in one place so you can
        support long-term educational, emotional, and mental growth with clarity and care.
      </p>
      <div class="landing-actions">
        <%= link_to "Sign In", new_user_session_path, class: "btn btn-primary" %>
      </div>
    </section>

    <aside class="landing-proof card">
      <h3>Why Families and Schools Choose Wayfinder</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Keep school communication, family notes, and records in one shared timeline</li>
        <li>Turn complex updates into clear, human-friendly insights and next steps</li>
        <li>Spot trends over time, not just one-time events</li>
        <li>Make more confident decisions for your child's wellbeing and progress</li>
      </ul>
    </aside>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="card landing-section">
  <h2>Features and Benefits</h2>
  <div class="landing-columns">
    <div>
      <h3>For Parents</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>See your child's full story in one place across school and home</li>
        <li>Track progress over time, including strengths, concerns, and turning points</li>
        <li>Get practical recommendations for what to do next</li>
        <li>Share context with trusted family members and stay coordinated</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>For Teachers</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Provide updates once and have them organized into a clear child timeline</li>
        <li>Share report cards, assessments, and progress notes with better continuity</li>
        <li>Help families understand trends between academic, emotional, and behavioral signals</li>
        <li>Reduce repeated back-and-forth by keeping everyone aligned on context</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>For Family Members</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Understand how your child is doing without needing every email thread</li>
        <li>Support routines at home with clearer visibility into current priorities</li>
        <li>Participate in the child's long-term growth plan with shared insight</li>
        <li>Stay informed in a respectful, focused, child-centered way</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>What Wayfinder Does</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Collects school messages, uploads, and records in one place</li>
        <li>Reads PDFs and scanned documents to capture important details</li>
        <li>Organizes grades and other data so growth can be tracked over time</li>
        <li>Creates narrative insights in plain language, not just raw data</li>
        <li>Highlights trends and recommends helpful next steps</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>Built for Long-Term Growth</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Supports educational growth by tracking academics over time</li>
        <li>Supports emotional growth by surfacing recurring social-emotional signals</li>
        <li>Supports mental growth by connecting context, patterns, and care decisions</li>
        <li>Keeps a trusted history so progress is visible across months and years</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
